A) Excess weight and B) Confidence boosters

Still, 83 wishes IS a bit much.

I polypiled several times...ended up with a Helm of Brilliance as the 
best of the take.

I was hit three times with amnesia...twice from thrown potions and once 
from a bath in the River Lethe.  It sucks having to go all the way back 
to Level 1 and remap.

I had been using Cockatrice Eggs to get rid of summoning baddies and 
named demons.  You can put Cockatrices on the list of creature I will 
NEVER EVER EVER genocide!

I died three times....once in Ludios when I was clearing the way to look 
